'' RUN: fb_DtZoneStandardName into a 4-byte buffer truncates and writes nothing past it. The
'' POSIX copy was a zstring STRING assignment per byte (TS-003's pattern); run the same
'' source on Linux in WSL for that side -- the packaged runtime before this commit overwrites
'' 8 guard bytes there.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/zone-name-trunc.tiko -o tests/codegen/zonenametrunc.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/zonenametrunc.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/zonenametrunc.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
